OL,3,ABrand, Walliams and MAFS: Is this a
OL,4,Areckoning for the entertainment
OL,5,Aindustry?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis week, the dark side of television
OL,8,Fhas come crashing into the open.
OL,10,FOn Monday, disgraced entertainer
OL,11,FRussell Brand was jailed for rape and
OL,12,Fsexual assault.
OL,14,FTwenty-four hours later, author and
OL,15,Fcomedian David Walliams was unmasked
OL,16,Fand accused of preying on young women.
OL,18,FBy Friday the Metropolitan Police had
OL,19,Flaunched an investigation into further
OL,20,Fallegations about him.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
