OL,3,AEurovision is finally coming to Asia -
OL,4,Ameet the stars gearing up to take the
OL,5,Astage
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Saturday, the biggest and
OL,8,Flongest-running international song
OL,9,Fcontest will make a leap into unknown
OL,10,Fterritory.
OL,12,FEurovision, the pan-European
OL,13,Fcompetition famed for zany gimmicks,
OL,14,Fslick, sometimes over-the-top staging,
OL,15,Fthe drama of its complex voting system
OL,16,Fand, occasionally, for outstanding
OL,17,Fmusic, celebrates its 70th birthday
OL,18,Fthis year.
OL,20,FAnd to mark it, the European
OL,21,FBroadcasting Union is trying out
OL,22,Faudiences in Asia.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
