OL,3,AEurovision is finally coming to Asia -
OL,4,Ameet the stars gearing up to take the
OL,5,Astage
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's an idea that's been talked about
OL,8,Ffor two decades but never materialised,
OL,9,Fdespite many false starts.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
